sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant N as network module
    participant S as C2Server (127.0.0.1)
    participant C as C2Client
    participant P as ScenarioPlayer
    participant X as Dispatcher

    N->>S: start(host=loopback, port=0)
    S-->>N: bound ephemeral port
    N->>C: connect()
    C->>S: register(session_id, capabilities) [HMAC]
    S-->>C: registered(policy, heartbeat_interval)
    par heartbeats
        loop N beats
            C->>S: heartbeat(seq)
            S-->>C: heartbeat_ack(beats)
        end
    and polling
        loop until scenario exhausted or budget
            C->>S: poll()
            S->>P: next_tasks(session)
            P-->>S: fixed task descriptors
            S-->>C: tasks(batch, remaining)
            loop each task
                C->>X: validate + handle(task)
                X-->>C: result(status, payload, duration)
                C->>S: result(task_id, status, result/error)
                S-->>C: result_ack
            end
        end
    end
    N->>C: close()
    N->>S: stop()
    Note over S: server tracks sessions,<br/>rejects replays, stale frames<br/>and unknown sessions
